**Still for the owner:** whether T8 is worth scheduling at all, and if so whether raise output may feed `lower-register`, which would let a host holding only H derive R. My recommendation is to leave T8 unscheduled until a foreign host actually needs to compile an image it did not produce. The edited document is uncommitted in the working tree.
